#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:3
#: c5f8a812013b47e2bff4f4237324b4eb
msgid "周期溶剂盒（Solvent Box Fill）"
msgstr "Solvent Box Fill"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:5
#: d3c79b024859461cadf93cec59a8a91e
msgid "**分类：** 分子与溶剂"
msgstr "**Category:** Molecules and Solvation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:7
#: bc1cf293479749b884eefe46f7dce940
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:9
#: f660c4e25ca64235bdeed13c74a3eef7
msgid ""
"`Solvent Box Fill` 保留宿主结构，并在已有 cell 的整个体积内随机插入同一种溶剂分子。输入可以没有原子，但必须有有限、非奇异的 "
"cell，并且至少开启一个周期方向。"
msgstr ""
"`Solvent Box Fill` preserves the host structure and randomly inserts molecules of one"
" solvent species throughout the volume of its existing cell. The input may contain no"
" atoms, but it must have a finite, nonsingular cell with at least one periodic "
"direction enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:11
#: 6979657d657640e6a9ef060d26ba8444
msgid "它用于补充整盒溶剂环境；若目标是围绕离子或指定原子构造第一溶剂壳，应使用 `Local Solvation`。"
msgstr ""
"Use it to add full-box solvent environments. To construct a first solvent shell "
"around ions or specified atoms, use `Local Solvation` instead."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:13
#: e988872ee743449698b43cc712205678
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:15
#: be76364992ee41de9f16971d0443616a
msgid "`固定分子数`直接使用用户给定数量。`按密度估算`根据晶胞体积 $V$、目标密度 $\\rho$、 填充比例 $p$ 和单个溶剂分子摩尔质量 $M$ 计算"
msgstr "`Fixed molecule count` uses the requested count directly. `Estimate from density` computes it from cell volume $V$, target density $\\rho$, fill fraction $p$, and the molar mass $M$ of one solvent molecule:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:18
#: d91f5e1a04394c9480f589a5a23b0700
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{solv}}=\n"
"\\max\\!\\left(1,\\operatorname{round}\n"
"\\frac{\\rho\\,(V\\times10^{-24})\\,p}{M/N_A}\\right),\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:24
#: d73304d64f374e1d82fee240595bc496
msgid "其中 $V$ 用 Å³、$\\rho$ 用 g/cm³、$M$ 用 g/mol。这里使用完整 cell 体积，不扣除宿主、已有溶剂或真空层占据的体积。"
msgstr ""
"Here, $V$ is in Å³, $\\rho$ in g/cm³, and $M$ in g/mol. The calculation uses the full"
" cell volume without subtracting the volume occupied by the host, existing solvent, "
"or vacuum regions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:26
#: 8538de00d2234b27818c2ac37ec5c089
msgid "每次试放会随机选择分子中心和整体取向。原子对 $i,j$ 的接受条件是"
msgstr ""
"Each placement attempt samples a random molecular center and overall orientation. An "
"atom pair $i,j$ is accepted when"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:28
#: 6dfdbf35f5b442b6893b93efbeb15988
msgid ""
"\n"
"d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}} \\ge\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"d_{\\min}, & d_{\\min}>0,\\\\\n"
"s(R_i+R_j), & d_{\\min}=0,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:36
#: f27f20e1e0f2455cae2849e0de9d7fa3
msgid ""
"其中 $d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}}$ 是只沿已开启周期方向计算的最小镜像距离，$R_i$、$R_j$ 是元素碰撞半径，$s$ "
"是间距倍率。统一最小距离和元素半径规则是**二选一**，不会叠加。"
msgstr ""
"Here, $d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}}$ is the minimum-image distance evaluated only along "
"enabled periodic directions, $R_i$ and $R_j$ are element collision radii, and $s$ is "
"the spacing factor. The global minimum-distance rule and the element-radius rule are "
"**mutually exclusive**; they are not combined."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:38
#: 0c8befa28eff4e19b323712a7fec6fa3
msgid "卡片只生成未经平衡的初始结构；密度模式中的 $\\rho$ 是数量估算输入，不代表输出已达到液体平衡密度。"
msgstr ""
"The card produces un-equilibrated starting structures only. In density mode, $\\rho$ "
"is an input for estimating molecule count; it does not mean the output has reached "
"the equilibrium liquid density."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:40
#: 0ca17b35f7bd4361ab778e1fc6c0910e
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:42
#: 80d1e1e6ad8e40df917e7e40f515e22d
msgid "场景：模型只见过真空表面，没有见过周期溶剂盒"
msgstr "Scenario: The model has seen vacuum surfaces but no periodic solvent box"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:44
#: dd1b5ae9ee1d4af4957aac3af1c1dd3d
msgid ""
"你要训练一个界面或溶液体系的 NEP，但已有训练集主要是干表面和单分子吸附构型。先准备带 cell 的周期输入结构，用 `Solvent Box Fill` "
"插入固定数量或按密度估算的水分子，生成一批整盒初态。"
msgstr ""
"For an interface or solution NEP whose data are mostly dry surfaces and single "
"adsorbates, begin from a periodic cell and insert a fixed or density-estimated "
"solvent count to propose full-box initial states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:46
#: dd8579c719264332843818f6e5a5277e
msgid ""
"参数设置：`count_mode=\"fixed\"`，`solvent_count=200`，`sampling_mode=\"general\"`，`min_distance=0.8`，`max_attempts_per_solvent=500`，打开"
" `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）。"
msgstr ""
"Settings: `count_mode=\"fixed\"`, `solvent_count=200`, `sampling_mode=\"general\"`, "
"`min_distance=0.8`, and `max_attempts_per_solvent=500`; enable `Use random seed` "
"(`use_seed`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:48
#: c6922ea6ef90426c91e5654f2d432bb5
msgid "检查输出时重点看是否插满、是否存在明显短接触、溶剂是否都包回 cell 内，以及后续预松弛是否大面积崩坏。"
msgstr ""
"Check whether the target count was reached, short contacts exist, molecules lie "
"within the periodic cell, and pre-relaxation remains stable."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:50
#: d566d867b6654c7eb947530655544f77
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:52
#: da50acb171674170a1fd63bc84586702
msgid "溶剂输入"
msgstr "Solvent input"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:54
#: b7350068561347e1ba31a6ca734081e6
msgid "溶剂 XYZ（solvent_xyz）"
msgstr "solvent_xyz"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:56
#: 1391adb51bbe476aa7dfab841a9920b7
msgid "`str`，默认是一个三原子水分子 XYZ。这里保存溶剂分子文本，而不是文件路径。"
msgstr "`str`, default a three-atom water XYZ block. Stores molecule text, not a path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:58
#: fe74f1e5a4804c3582bccbfa110f6728
msgid "每个输入的独立输出数（structures）"
msgstr "structures"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:60
#: 2dd3f2ba75a44353925040761843ec0e
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构生成多少个独立填充版本。"
msgstr "`int`, default `1`. Independent box-fill variants per input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:62
#: e82b3eb9ee564604924c4a546347ae80
msgid "数量控制"
msgstr "Count control"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:64
#: d7a29174fddf40a68050370283d45d56
msgid "目标用量（count_mode）"
msgstr "count_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:66
#: cc9c2bf4560a4c8a876e4c6338afa50a
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `density`。可选 `fixed`、`按密度`（`density`）。`fixed` "
"直接使用目标分子数；`按密度`（`density`）根据**完整 cell 体积**、溶剂分子质量、目标密度和数量乘数估算一个名义分子数。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `density`. Available values are `fixed` and `By density` (`density`). "
"`fixed` uses the target molecule count directly. `By density` estimates a nominal "
"molecule count from the **full cell volume**, solvent molecular mass, target density,"
" and count multiplier."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:68
#: 87b2b77e62144b66b555d37db81a710b
msgid "目标溶剂分子数（solvent_count）"
msgstr "solvent_count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:70
#: e518dff3f8ff44739b44c1e00cc33baa
msgid "`int`，默认 100，仅在主动切换到 `count_mode=\"fixed\"` 后生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default 100. Used only after explicitly switching to `count_mode=\"fixed\"`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:72
#: 78274b2460d04b47bf196f271ba5343b
msgid "按密度（density）"
msgstr "density"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:74
#: c1e169ca092d46d0a0ba7f91252571a5
msgid "`float`，默认 1.0，单位 g/cm³。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时用于估算溶剂分子数量。"
msgstr "`float`, default `1.0` g/cm³; density mode only."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:76
#: 63473bb3b1d2480087a3dda9c382c6fe
msgid "完整 cell 计数系数（fill_packing）"
msgstr "Full-Cell Count Factor (fill_packing)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:78
#: aab6af2225854c3cb7cbbe7b0ce0673b
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 1.0，范围 `(0, 1]`。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时乘到完整 cell 的名义纯溶剂分子数上；小于 1 "
"会降低目标数量。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 1.0, range `(0, 1]`. With `count_mode=\"density\"`, this multiplies "
"the nominal pure-solvent molecule count for the full cell. Values below 1 reduce the "
"target count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:81
#: c0cc54c5707e40a3b1bab8d246ed553f
msgid ""
"密度模式不会扣除宿主原子、已有溶剂或真空层占据的体积，也不会根据溶质质量反算最终溶液密度。对含表面、溶质或大块固体的 cell，它只是按完整 cell "
"体积给出的初始数量估计；请看卡片预览中的解析数量，再用 `完整 cell 计数系数`（`fill_packing`）或固定数量修正。"
msgstr ""
"Density mode does not subtract the volume occupied by host atoms, existing solvent, "
"or vacuum regions, and it does not infer the final solution density from solute mass."
" For a cell containing a surface, solute, or bulk solid, it is only an initial count "
"estimate based on the full cell volume. Check the resolved count in the card preview,"
" then correct it with `Full-cell count factor` (`fill_packing`) or a fixed count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:84
#: 4f4c950e76654cf6a4a3fe63bc263144
msgid "采样和几何约束"
msgstr "Sampling and geometry constraints"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:86
#: dc81c26789de40dba214ab722bf557e1
msgid "碰撞配置（sampling_mode）"
msgstr "sampling_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:88
#: d6ee24637a674c4d928d2698d88b08e9
msgid "`str`，默认 `general`。界面提供三档真实有差异的间距倍率："
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `general`. The interface provides three spacing-factor presets with "
"distinct behavior:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 92af632c5c544446842358c1ef01fc6b
msgid "界面选项"
msgstr "Interface option"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: fa055f390d894486ab33049853833498
msgid "序列化值"
msgstr "Serialized value"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: dd15178761c146f6ad9590eb4a150b7a
msgid "$s$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: b04487c949c64e6aa57557310db713c8
msgid "效果"
msgstr "Effect"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 5768723b8b124839be81e1f1bd452dc2
msgid "紧凑间距"
msgstr "Compact spacing"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: d48d316362be488cb05b398d95260218
msgid "`loose`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 1e631ca5f2774d27a34d294ee631c402
msgid "0.62"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 6737a9c2c2c24a9fa67f5909d037ab24
msgid "允许分子靠得更近，更容易插满"
msgstr "Allows molecules to approach more closely, making the target count easier to reach"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 16675c15b455477487b64cac79000fdc
msgid "标准间距"
msgstr "Standard spacing"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: f9ac0d60c32b484eb3bb4d89e767ed89
msgid "`general`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 981ceb94e9e84e32a170b98a87ed0b23
msgid "0.70"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: aeab7a3e865a4926922e5edcfa7aadae
msgid "默认选择"
msgstr "Default choice"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 26cff18041724dfab8215b0ec1f06922
msgid "保守间距"
msgstr "Conservative spacing"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: efa8bf3e3492429b9d3483538d3f4e70
msgid "`dense`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 94852584b9cd4f99aeb7a222c9921e60
msgid "0.78"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: a410a57f52b542d1b042249f1907c128
msgid "留出更大原子间距，更可能提前耗尽尝试"
msgstr ""
"Leaves larger interatomic distances and is more likely to exhaust the attempt budget "
"early"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:96
#: 89d4b4ebb47642d09c571f290758390d
msgid ""
"旧工作流中的 `auto` 和 `water` 仍可加载，并按标准倍率 0.70 运行；重新在界面保存后会归一为 "
"`general`。三档都只改变碰撞间距，分子中心和整体取向始终随机。"
msgstr ""
"Legacy workflows using `auto` or `water` can still be loaded and run with the "
"standard factor of 0.70. Saving them again in the interface normalizes the value to "
"`general`. All three presets change collision spacing only; molecular centers and "
"overall orientations remain random."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:98
#: 30a1ef0c78674abf82d1b2b194a87fcb
msgid "统一最小距离覆盖值（min_distance）"
msgstr "min_distance"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:100
#: c9eb3e1b97134c0d9273b769f85d0f58
msgid "`float`，默认 0，单位 Å。大于 0 时，所有原子对都使用该统一距离，并禁用间距预设和元素半径倍率；等于 0 时使用元素半径规则。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 0, in Å. When greater than 0, all atom pairs use this uniform "
"distance and both spacing presets and element-radius factors are disabled. A value of"
" 0 uses the element-radius rule."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:102
#: f5a13cfe4f104d539a7222ab30ace8bc
msgid "元素半径碰撞缩放（collision_scale）"
msgstr "collision_scale"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:104
#: c9eb3e1b97134c0d9273b769f85d0f58
msgid "`float`，默认 0。等于 0 时使用间距预设；大于 0 时覆盖预设。仅在 `min_distance=0` 时生效。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 0. A value of 0 uses the spacing preset; a positive value overrides "
"the preset. It applies only when `min_distance=0`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:106
#: 1df5d078c7e14da6a0b2c191591c84f2
msgid "每个溶剂分子最大尝试次数（max_attempts_per_solvent）"
msgstr "max_attempts_per_solvent"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:108
#: c62d89b189cc4cd891aa8b3c9391f6d2
msgid "`int`，默认 500。总尝试上限是“该值 × 目标分子数”；若连续拒绝次数达到内部停滞阈值，也会提前停止。高密度盒子触顶时，优先检查目标数量和碰撞规则，再考虑增加它。"
msgstr "`int`, default 500. The total attempt limit is this value multiplied by the target molecule count; the run also stops early after the internal consecutive-rejection threshold. If a dense box reaches the limit, check the target count and collision rules before increasing it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:110
#: a6451a2e7561462b94acbb1d7c2492ee
msgid "严格数量（strict_count）"
msgstr "strict_count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:112
#: 76a92b8b1a0f4ae7af468acff6b797ff
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。打开后，未插满目标数量就失败；关闭后允许输出至少放入 1 个分子的部分结果。若一个分子都放不进去，仍会报错，避免把未变化的输入标成“已填盒”。"
msgstr "`bool`, default true. When enabled, failure to insert the full target count is an error. When disabled, a partial result is allowed if at least one molecule was inserted. Inserting none still raises an error so an unchanged input is never labeled as a filled box."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:114
#: 7b87230cd61c483ca92d9ec0817b7e4d
msgid "柔性溶剂"
msgstr "Flexible solvent molecules"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:116
#: 8281dc63e56942d3bdc3e46250cb3d33
msgid "启用柔性溶剂（flex_solvent）"
msgstr "flex_solvent"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:118
#: d28f80d2be8c42dea4164a6937713295
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后复用“分子构象”的几何启发式拓扑生成溶剂构象池，再用于填盒。水没有可旋转单键，因此普通水盒不需要打开；打开后主要只增加高斯坐标噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false. When enabled, the geometric-topology heuristic from `Molecular"
" Conformers` generates a solvent conformer pool for box filling. Water has no "
"rotatable single bond, so an ordinary water box does not need this option; enabling "
"it mainly adds Gaussian coordinate noise."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:120
#: da291e38d14a470d92b0a72e3571f26c
msgid "柔性构象池（flex_pool）"
msgstr "flex_pool"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:122
#: bdc099cd3c644ec0bc2bd87a69d01d1d
msgid "`int`，默认 32。柔性溶剂构象池大小。"
msgstr "`int`, default `32`. Size of the conformer pool for a flexible solvent."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:124
#: 6377b4e559b546b2b75a2e546df75bcf
msgid "柔性扭转角范围（flex_torsion_range）"
msgstr "flex_torsion_range"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:126
#: 726ae1ab99aa4f25ab4e3f6f44fe1212
msgid "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`，单位 degree。柔性构象生成时附加的扭转角增量范围。"
msgstr "`tuple[float, float]`, default `(-180.0, 180.0)`, in degrees. Range of additional torsion-angle increments used when generating flexible conformers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:128
#: 37b82cdb521f4b86bbc8f2a0a787e966
msgid "柔性采样最大扭转键数（flex_max_torsions）"
msgstr "flex_max_torsions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:130
#: c9da4eaa618c4458bb76902b472d5947
msgid "`int`，默认 5。每个柔性构象最多扰动多少个可旋转键。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `5`. Maximum number of rotatable bonds perturbed in each flexible "
"conformer."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:132
#: 6c64dc2a83ce4369b4b409618549e455
msgid "柔性采样高斯宽度（flex_gaussian_sigma）"
msgstr "flex_gaussian_sigma"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:134
#: 94f7f9771f0c4d2981d26bcf6ebb8ec0
msgid "`float`，默认 0.03，单位 Å。柔性构象生成时叠加的坐标噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.03` Å. Coordinate noise added while generating flexible "
"conformers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:136
