#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:189
#: 29eea05daf4d410a8ada57819187e94b
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:191
#: a8374cd94da742b28d4573c1bc9e1800
msgid "`Solvent Box Fill → Geometry Filter`：先剔除短接触和明显异常盒子。"
msgstr "`Solvent Box Fill` -> `Geometry Filter`: reject short contacts and abnormal boxes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:192
#: c54497ccfcba4048a7998265110a24c5
msgid "`Solvent Box Fill → FPS Filter`：整盒初态很多时，用代表性采样降低 DFT 数量。"
msgstr ""
"`Solvent Box Fill` -> `FPS Filter`: reduce many initial boxes to representative DFT "
"candidates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:194
#: 6e72c8c167d84602b689132b0961fb76
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:196
#: 3f778311b0ca4257b927c2c2cd176758
msgid "输入没有有效周期 cell：这张卡需要非奇异 cell 和至少一个周期方向；非周期局部溶剂环境请用 `Local Solvation`。"
msgstr ""
"No valid periodic cell: use a nonsingular cell with periodicity, or choose `Local "
"Solvation` for a nonperiodic local environment."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:197
#: 016a2e8a99bd47659eacfeb441c31042
msgid "无法插满目标数量：先看预览中的目标分子数和名义纯溶剂密度；再降低数量或完整 cell 计数系数、减小碰撞距离，或者增大 cell。关闭严格数量后可保留非零的部分结果。"
msgstr ""
"Cannot reach the target count: first inspect the target molecule count and nominal "
"pure-solvent density in the preview. Then reduce the count or full-cell count factor,"
" reduce the collision distance, or enlarge the cell. Disabling strict count retains a"
" nonzero partial result."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:198
#: 2834ba483d544277aeb6f572fc39a683
msgid ""
"按密度估算的数量不符合预期：数量由完整 cell 体积、溶剂分子质量、目标密度和数量乘数共同决定，不会扣除宿主占据体积。先检查 cell 单位、真空层、已有原子和 `溶剂"
" XYZ`（`solvent_xyz`）。"
msgstr ""
"The density-derived count is unexpected: it uses the full cell volume, solvent molecular mass, target density, and count multiplier, without subtracting the host's occupied volume. Check the cell units, vacuum region, existing atoms, and `Solvent XYZ` (`solvent_xyz`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:199
#: a5699e9dc40346a18cbee796a67a1e94
msgid "想生成离子第一水合壳：改用 `Local Solvation`。整盒卡不会按离子元素选择 ion–O 距离或水分子取向。"
msgstr "To generate an ion's first hydration shell, use `Local Solvation`. Whole-box filling does not choose ion–O distances or water orientations according to the ion element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:201
#: 5b756fb51d3441f6b7a412409db2dbd1
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:203
#: 0f5f42080ae747708d9e4af2ee1d32d6
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`SolvBox(mode={mode},req={target},ok={placed})`"
msgstr "`SolvBox(mode={mode},req={target},ok={placed})`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:205
#: fc746205db1a4ce18f7b426f5836673a
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:207
#: b5258263fba34a39927dbdb16ea29d21
msgid ""
"打开 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）后，相同输入结构、结构顺序、参数和 "
"`随机种子`（`seed`）会生成相同填盒结果。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时，cell 体积或 `溶剂 "
"XYZ`（`solvent_xyz`）改变会改变目标分子数，因此输出也会改变。"
msgstr ""
"With `Use random seed` (`use_seed`) enabled, the same input structures, structure order, parameters, and `seed` produce the same packing result. When `count_mode=\"density\"`, changing the cell volume or `solvent_xyz` changes the target molecule count and therefore the output."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Solvent Box Fill` "
#~ "在已有周期性晶胞中插入溶剂分子，适合从干结构或稀疏溶剂结构生成整盒溶剂候选初态。输入结构必须有非奇异 cell，并且至少一个周期方向开启。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Solvent Box Fill` inserts solvent molecules "
#~ "into an existing periodic cell to create "
#~ "a full-box candidate from a dry or "
#~ "sparsely solvated structure. Input needs a "
#~ "nonsingular cell and at least one periodic "
#~ "direction."

#~ msgid "它解决的是“训练集缺少周期溶剂环境”的覆盖问题，不替代分子动力学平衡或量化优化。输出仍需要做几何筛查和后续 DFT/MD 处理。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "It addresses missing periodic solvent environments;"
#~ " it does not replace MD equilibration or"
#~ " quantum optimization. Output still requires "
#~ "geometry checks and downstream DFT/MD treatment."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "参数设置：`count_mode=\"fixed\"`，`solvent_count=200`，`sampling_mode=\"auto\"`，`min_distance=0.8`，`max_attempts_per_solvent=500`，打开"
#~ " `use_seed`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Parameters: `count_mode=\"fixed\"`, `solvent_count=200`, "
#~ "`sampling_mode=\"auto\"`, `min_distance=0.8`, "
#~ "`max_attempts_per_solvent=500`, and `use_seed` enabled."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `fixed`。可选 `fixed`、`density`。`fixed` 直接使用 "
#~ "`solvent_count`；`density` 根据 cell 体积、溶剂分子质量、`density` 和"
#~ " `fill_packing` 估算数量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `fixed`. `fixed` uses "
#~ "`solvent_count`; `density` estimates count from cell"
#~ " volume, molecule mass, `density`, and "
#~ "`fill_packing`."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 1.0。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时作为密度缩放因子；小于 1 会降低目标分子数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `1.0`. Packing multiplier for "
#~ "density-based count; values below 1 reduce "
#~ "the target."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `auto`。可选 "
#~ "`auto`、`general`、`water`、`loose`、`dense`。整盒填充不会因为盒子里有离子就自动切到 `ion-"
#~ "water`，因为它没有局部中心原子。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `auto`. Options are `auto`, "
#~ "`general`, `water`, `loose`, and `dense`. Full-"
#~ "box filling has no local center and "
#~ "therefore does not automatically select `ion-"
#~ "water`."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0。大于 0 时作为全局原子-原子最小距离；等于 0 时使用元素碰撞半径和 `collision_scale`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0`. A positive value is "
#~ "the global minimum atom-atom distance. At "
#~ "`0`, element-specific collision radii scaled "
#~ "by `collision_scale` are used."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0。等于 0 时使用 `sampling_mode` 的内置半径缩放；大于 0 时覆盖模式默认值。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0`. Zero uses the mode's "
#~ "collision scaling; a positive value overrides "
#~ "it as minimum distance."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 500。每个目标溶剂分子的最大随机放置尝试次数。高密度盒子触顶时，优先检查目标数量和 `min_distance`，再考虑增加它。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `500`. Placement attempts per "
#~ "requested molecule. At high density, check "
#~ "count and collision distances before increasing "
#~ "it."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 true。打开后，未插满目标数量就失败；关闭后允许输出部分填充结果。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `true`. Fail unless the target"
#~ " count is reached; disabled permits partial "
#~ "fill."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后复用仓库已有 torsion-guard core 生成溶剂构象池，再用于填盒。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `false`. Generate a solvent "
#~ "conformer pool with torsion-guard before "
#~ "filling."

#~ msgid "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`，单位 degree。柔性构象生成时的扭转角范围。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float]`, default `(-180.0, 180.0)` "
#~ "degrees. Torsion-angle range used to generate"
#~ " flexible conformers."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "无法插满目标数量：降低 `solvent_count` 或 `fill_packing`，减小 "
#~ "`min_distance` 或 `collision_scale`，增大 cell；也可以关闭 "
#~ "`strict_count` 先保留部分可用候选。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Cannot reach the target: reduce count/packing, "
#~ "revise collision limits, enlarge the cell, or"
#~ " disable `strict_count` to retain partial "
#~ "candidates."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按密度估算的数量不符合预期：数量由 cell 体积、溶剂分子质量、`density` 和 "
#~ "`fill_packing` 共同决定，先检查 cell 单位、真空层和 `solvent_xyz` "
#~ "是否正确。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Unexpected density-based count: verify cell "
#~ "units, vacuum volume, solvent mass/text, density,"
#~ " and packing factor."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "打开 `use_seed` 后，相同输入结构、结构顺序、参数和 `seed` "
#~ "会生成相同填盒结果。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时，cell 体积或 `solvent_xyz` "
#~ "改变会改变目标分子数，因此输出也会改变。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "With `use_seed`, identical input, order, parameters,"
#~ " and seed reproduce filling. In density "
#~ "mode, changing cell volume or solvent text "
#~ "changes the target count and output."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "它解决的是“训练集缺少周期溶剂环境”的覆盖问题，不替代分子动力学平衡或量化优化。各模式下分子位置和整体取向都采用随机采样；`water`、`loose`、`dense`"
#~ " 主要改变默认碰撞半径缩放，并不会生成局部离子水合取向。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "其中 $V$ 用 Å³、$\\rho$ 用 g/cm³、$M$ 用 "
#~ "g/mol。随后随机平移和旋转每个溶剂分子， 并用周期最小镜像距离执行碰撞拒绝；显式最小距离与元素共价半径缩放共同决定是否接受。 "
#~ "因此密度模式给出的是目标装填数，不代表未经弛豫的瞬时结构已经达到真实液体平衡密度。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `auto`。可选 `auto`、`general`、`water`、`loose`、`dense`。`auto` "
#~ "只根据溶剂分子是否恰好为 H₂O 解析成 `water` 或 "
#~ "`general`；整盒填充没有局部中心，因此不会进入 `ion-water`。这些配置主要控制 "
#~ "`min_distance=0` 时的默认元素半径缩放，分子整体取向始终是随机的。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "{\n"
#~ "  \"class\": \"SolventBoxFillCard\",\n"
#~ "  \"check_state\": true,\n"
#~ "  \"params\": {\n"
#~ "    \"structures\": 1,\n"
#~ "    \"count_mode\": \"fixed\",\n"
#~ "    \"solvent_count\": 200,\n"
#~ "    \"sampling_mode\": \"auto\",\n"
#~ "    \"min_distance\": 0.8,\n"
#~ "    \"max_attempts_per_solvent\": 500,\n"
#~ "    \"strict_count\": true,\n"
#~ "    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
#~ "    \"seed\": 42\n"
#~ "  }\n"
#~ "}\n"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "{\n"
#~ "  \"class\": \"SolventBoxFillCard\",\n"
#~ "  \"check_state\": true,\n"
#~ "  \"params\": {\n"
#~ "    \"structures\": 3,\n"
#~ "    \"count_mode\": \"density\",\n"
#~ "    \"density\": 1.0,\n"
#~ "    \"fill_packing\": 0.7,\n"
#~ "    \"sampling_mode\": \"water\",\n"
#~ "    \"min_distance\": 0.85,\n"
#~ "    \"max_attempts_per_solvent\": 800,\n"
#~ "    \"strict_count\": false,\n"
#~ "    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
#~ "    \"seed\": 7\n"
#~ "  }\n"
#~ "}\n"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "无法插满目标数量：降低固定数量或密度数量乘数，减小统一最小距离或元素半径缩放，增大 cell；也可以关闭严格数量先保留非零的部分结果。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."
